OL,3,GNEWSANo-shows costing restaurants
OL,4,Athousands in lost takings
OL,5,
OL,6,FRestaurant owners in the Channel
OL,7,FIslands have said people not showing up
OL,8,Fafter booking tables is costing them
OL,9,Fthousands of pounds.
OL,11,FSome are taking measures to try and
OL,12,Fprevent no-shows including taking down
OL,13,Fcredit card details and asking for
OL,14,Fdeposits.
OL,16,FWhen customers do not turn up it costs
OL,17,Fthe restaurants money, and can also
OL,18,Flead to good food being thrown away,
OL,19,Frestaurateurs said.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
