OL,3,GNEWSANo-shows costing restaurants
OL,4,Athousands in lost takings
OL,5,
OL,6,FSam Jarrold, managing director of
OL,7,FFukku, a Japanese restaurant in St
OL,8,FPeter Port, Guernsey, said the business
OL,9,Flost #50,000 from no-shows in a year
OL,10,F"which is significant when trying to
OL,11,Fmaintain a business that already has
OL,12,Fvery fine margins".
